# The workspace ICFG provider lever (#11570).
#
# Add one `<issue>-<slug>` line when a change alters what a provider-derived
# cached product means for unchanged inputs: for example a resolution or
# dispatch answer that changes without a language salt change. The full
# behavior domain and the read behavior domain are both derived from this one
# file, so they always move together. Git merges this file with merge=union,
# so two branches that each add a line keep both. Never edit or remove a line;
# compaction replaces a prefix with a checkpoint line and keeps the identity.
# See .agents/docs/cache-identity-levers.md.
